  "$stripeGroupsComment": [
    "Used by StripeMode.Genre. Splitting along a thematic boundary makes the two stripes'",
    "vocabulary and term-frequency distributions diverge, which is what makes their BM25 IDF",
    "values incomparable. That is the failure this sample exists to measure, so the genre split",
    "is the interesting configuration and the random split is the control.",
    "Books with no allow-listed genre fall back to the deterministic hash split."
  ],
